{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "9e401d22-21c0-893a-bcb2-b22f7f0f1137",
  "created_at": "2026-03-03T11:20:31-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Jose Herrera",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tony Ferreira",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:16:23-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Tony. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:16:28-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hey Tony, yeah, Jose Herrera. Can you hear me okay? I've got one bar here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:16:35-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're a little choppy but I've got you. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:16:40-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So, I grew up down by the harbor, right, and my grandfather used to say the water bill was the one thing in this town that always showed up on time. Well, it showed up. With a late fee on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:16:57-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ah, okay. A late fee. Let's take a look. What's the service address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:17:03-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "314 Narragansett Avenue. Fifth Ward. I rent there, but the bill's in my name."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:17:09-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, give me a second to pull that up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:17:14-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:17:15-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I see the account. There's a late charge on the most recent bill. What's the issue?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:17:22-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I mailed the check. On time. Like a week before it was due. [line breaks up] and now I'm paying extra for something I did right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:17:33-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, you broke up there. You mailed it about a week before the due date?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:17:40-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, a week before. I have the paper bill right here in my hand. Hold on. It says the bill date is February second, and the due date is, uh, February twenty-seventh."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:17:53-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And what day did you put the check in the mail, roughly?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:17:59-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The twentieth. A Friday. I remember because I did it on the way to work."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:18:05-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Here's what I'm seeing. Our system shows the payment posted on March second. So it didn't reach us until after the due date. Mail can be slow, especially in winter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:18:17-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ten days? For a letter across town? That's not me being late, that's the post office."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:18:24-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. Generally the charge goes by the date we receive payment, not the postmark. But I can note your account and send a request to have the late fee reviewed. I can't promise how it comes out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:18:39-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, please do that. I'm not paying a fee for a thing I didn't do."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:18:45-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll put the mailing date in the note. Do you still have the check number or the date it cleared your bank?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:18:54-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can look it up later. [inaudible] cleared, I think the, uh, the second or third."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:19:01-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That helps. If you can find it, call back and we'll add it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:19:07-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And look, so I don't get stuck again. If I drop a payment in the box tonight, after you're closed, does that count as on time?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:19:18-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. There's a drop box at City Hall, and payments left in it are collected the next business day. Generally it's counted as received by the date it goes in, as long as it's before the due date. You can also pay online anytime, day or night, and that posts right away."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:19:39-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Online, huh. Okay. I might do that from now on. Mail's not working for me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:19:45-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Online is the safest if you're close to the deadline. The bill should have instructions on the front."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:19:53-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I see something about a website. Alright. Hey, Tony, can I ask, are you from around here? You sound like it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:20:02-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Born and raised in Newport. Over by the Fifth Ward, actually, not far from you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:20:08-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I knew it. [line breaks up] hear it right away."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:20:13-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ha. So, I've got the review request noted on your account. Someone will follow up. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:20:20-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Thanks. Just fix the fee."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:20:24-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We'll take a look. You have a good one, Jose."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-03T11:20:29-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too."
    }
  ],
